OL,3,CChief Constable of major police force
OL,4,Cannounces retirement
OL,6,FThe Chief Constable of Cheshire
OL,7,FConstabulary has announced his
OL,8,Fretirement after five years in the
OL,9,Frole.
OL,11,FMark Roberts QPM will end his 33 year
OL,12,Fcareer in policing in 2026, which saw
OL,13,Fhim start as a constable in Salford
OL,14,Fbefore working his way up to the most
OL,15,Fsenior role within Cheshire Police.
OL,17,FIn a statement, the 58-year-old said
OL,18,Fhe had "hoped to take the force
OL,19,Fthrough to 2028" but a decision had
OL,20,Fbeen made to take Cheshire Police "in
OL,21,Fa different direction".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
