CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786358876
OL,3,CChief Constable of major police force
OL,4,Cannounces retirement
OL,6,FThe Chief Constable said he was proud
OL,7,Fto leave the force "at the top of its
OL,8,Fgame" but said he had "no doubt"
OL,9,Fimprovements will continue.
OL,11,FHe said: "Recently we have been ranked
OL,12,Ftop in the country for crime outcome
OL,13,Frates, and we had the highest charge/
OL,14,Fsummons outcome rate in the UK for
OL,15,Foverall crime.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
