OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786358876
OL,3,CChief Constable of major police force
OL,4,Cannounces retirement
OL,6,F"We are the best performing force for
OL,7,Ftackling violence offences, stalking
OL,8,Fand harassment, sexual offences and
OL,9,Fburglary and have some of the highest
OL,10,Fcharge rates in the country for
OL,11,Fvehicle crime and shoplifting."
OL,13,F"This is on top of last year's HMICFRS
OL,14,Finspection, where we were the only
OL,15,FForce to be graded as 'outstanding' in
OL,16,Fmanaging offenders and suspects, and
OL,17,Fone of only two forces to be graded as
OL,18,F'outstanding' for protecting
OL,19,Fvulnerable people," he added.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
