PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786358876
OL,3,CChief Constable of major police force
OL,4,Cannounces retirement
OL,6,FChief Constable Roberts began his
OL,7,Fcareer with Greater Manchester Police
OL,8,Fas a constable, before moving into an
OL,9,Finvestigative role.
OL,11,FHe said: "I was proud to be divisional
OL,12,Fcommander of Trafford where I grew up,
OL,13,Fbut as a Manchester City fan it was a
OL,14,Fdifficult time to police United as
OL,15,Fthey dominated football at the time."
OL,17,FOver the course of 20 years, he played
OL,18,Fan operational roles in high profile
OL,19,Fincidents with the force, including
OL,20,Fthe 2011 riots.
OL,26,@sD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
