PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786358876
OL,3,CChief Constable of major police force
OL,4,Cannounces retirement
OL,6,FHe went on to become the Deputy Chief
OL,7,FConstable for South Yorkshire Police,
OL,8,Fbut says the "pinnacle" of his career
OL,9,Fwas working as the Chief Constable for
OL,10,FCheshire Constabulary from 2021.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
